", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mJq0tnaxAwAQ7kNvwHhA9lf&_nc_oc=AdpkwFnByBV6RmxGFwtEGpqVzalsTDOEjxDRSOlhJmp9L0IXnbK74_9OdlaaNJfSf2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3s8aTd1ehTN9sD0Arz44Rcy-1gZjdJpAphzXuY0M_Qlw&oe=69D8FD79"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n_D2GOkHTA0Q7kNvwEMLX4R&_nc_oc=Adpcx7omtDbg-ytg8nZFpVl-Hd2QzQRpqanTfWKuLOQ-afpd18Q23iMVd-a8YJChU4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3l1TNTyK2KRZD1PJjXmjrj4g2tpk5vVzYZoYOzXLk83g&oe=69D8DC0B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zYY3mI5NlMQ7kNvwGLlYzw&_nc_oc=AdqRo6xZudkffmoJ-DHgDV-xqZSUDSRh-8zeJVd1EFDR--nK-8E3PRg3pFyWTSfvTus&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1MbGQuhhV-PczLvJvekE8LlasP_fSDB_VVVE-z-C9lmw&oe=69D8DA8E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel